   "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go Beyond Limits : THE WORLD CLASS MMORPG</h2><br><i>黑色沙漠使用REMASTERED擬真圖像和優美的音樂構成<br>展現MMORPG極限的黑色沙漠，能身歷其境參與刺激的戰鬥與攻城戰<br>還有探險、貿易、釣魚、馴養、煉金、料理、採集、狩獵等豐富的生活系統<br>來廣闊的世界中享受多樣的內容吧！<br>The MMORPG 黑色沙漠</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >您真正期望的冒險的開始</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/d238c0af53394d5834b74ebb76de3fcb.poster.avif?t=1786645008\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/d238c0af53394d5834b74ebb76de3fcb.webm?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/d238c0af53394d5834b74ebb76de3fcb.mp4?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>OPEN WORLD</strong><br>無論想體驗自給自足的農耕生活，亦或雇用勞動者大量生產創造商業利潤，<br>多樣化生產模式滿足你不同的渴望。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/ee3a9c9b45163f77fb116f246a33bcdf.poster.avif?t=1786645008\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/ee3a9c9b45163f77fb116f246a33bcdf.webm?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/ee3a9c9b45163f77fb116f246a33bcdf.mp4?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CUSTOMIZING</strong><br><i>完美訂製獨一無二的樣貌</i><br>細微如骨骼、臉部線條到每吋肌膚質感，超高自由度的創角系統蘊含無限可能。<br>夢想中的樣貌，就在《黑色沙漠》完美呈現！<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/504ccdbab0daf992ee34d6adda5f4561.poster.avif?t=1786645008\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/504ccdbab0daf992ee34d6adda5f4561.webm?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/504ccdbab0daf992ee34d6adda5f4561.mp4?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>GRAPHICS</strong><br><i>前所未見高規格畫面</i><br>保留真實世界的繁複與細膩，從壯麗的自然景觀到熟悉的生活場景，<br>每一瞬光影流洩都令人讚嘆。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/f334d1048e0a7954c0e81c2efb6625cc.poster.avif?t=1786645008\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/f334d1048e0a7954c0e81c2efb6625cc.webm?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/f334d1048e0a7954c0e81c2efb6625cc.mp4?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>COMBAT</strong><br><i>無鎖定模式的爽快戰鬥</i><br>終結傳統MMORPG死板、單一的定位式戰鬥，<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/c9902df8df97d6ed391205c4ae83d184.poster.avif?t=1786645008\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/c9902df8df97d6ed391205c4ae83d184.webm?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/c9902df8df97d6ed391205c4ae83d184.mp4?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>NODE &amp; SIEGE WAR</strong><br><i>攻城掠地大規模國戰</i><br>集結兵力與資源，引領眾人的力量在沙場一決勝負<br>獲勝的公會不僅能成為領主，更能控制稅收、掌握地方資源。<br>講求反應速度與操作技巧，享受高動作感的爽快打擊！<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/6dd59720b66b2db2c51af6865347124b.poster.avif?t=1786645008\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/6dd59720b66b2db2c51af6865347124b.webm?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582660/extras/6dd59720b66b2db2c51af6865347124b.mp4?t=1786645008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>LIFE SKILLS</strong><br><i>多元、豐富的生產活動</i><br>想要遊玩戰鬥以外的內容嗎？<br>那麼一邊休息，一邊享受豐富又愉快的生活活動吧！<br>耕種、貿易、釣魚、航海、料理、馴養、煉金等，無窮無盡的生活類型任君選擇。<br>來體驗豐富的生活內容吧！",
